    mcast-rule action flood utility to avoid snooping for custom multicast groups

    Change-Id: Id04ec124d09ed38a41fc17ec0ab53c8b50340195
    Signed-off-by: KRITHI D SHETTY <kdshetty@qti.qualcomm.com>
